        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Ada Tours may replace the listed hotels with others in the same category."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:aad34780a245497e",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "fa944f9d9af8080ca5fdf39ccce5fea505c0b5eaaa385862de1e68d643d97a5b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "The order of excursions may change, with the overall tour programme kept intact."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:64d02759479179f7",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "68babc2b96391a49bab60e7959a09c3adcbd424248b10123a98cca4d5309ba74",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Ada Tours is not responsible for missed hotel breakfasts when you have to check out early for a flight or excursion."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:5cd7a3d146d31311",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "71898c2182f8c1cc0f9df3e1228c683a4aba4f2ce351237afaf43b493cbd2b8c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arrival in Lima"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "30d9eeafd3ccc71bc7b4a2d3e8be91ec828067f5a90afebbad4c3a263b761e3d",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arrive at Jorge Chávez International Airport, where you will be met and taken to your hotel. Check in and spend some free time unwinding after your flight.\n\nLima is the first stop on the wider itinerary, and you will return to the city later in the trip, between the Peru and Colombia portions. There are no scheduled tours on the first day, so you can rest or head out for a short walk."
    },
